(5149924, 749545, 99981, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea and the sensitivity you had to see those words in this place. The position of the carts so stucked with the OUT OF BUSINE... are really cool! I just think there are some distractive objects at this photo, like the parts of the car and the pillar. Try to jump out of the car next time and than give a different perspective to the photo! Good idea and good luck!</td>', 'I really like your idea and the sensitivity you had to see those words in this place. The position of the carts so stucked with the OUT OF BUSINE... are really cool! I just think there are some distractive objects at this photo, like the parts of the car and the pillar. Try to jump out of the car next time and than give a different perspective to the photo! Good idea and good luck!', '2008-12-24 16:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
