(5149940, 749649, 99981, '<td valign="top">In my opinion you got a great expression and perspective of the woman looking at the dress, it really shows some feelings between them, hehe. The border, the focus and the B&amp;W make me like your photo too. There are just some points which i think you can change...The lights on the window are kind of distracting, and could be less with some adjustments, so as the woman being so dark and the harsh parts at the model. Good idea and good photo!</td>', 'In my opinion you got a great expression and perspective of the woman looking at the dress, it really shows some feelings between them, hehe. The border, the focus and the B&W make me like your photo too. There are just some points which i think you can change...The lights on the window are kind of distracting, and could be less with some adjustments, so as the woman being so dark and the harsh parts at the model. Good idea and good photo!', '2008-12-24 16:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
