(5154159, 748379, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the disorienting feeling found in the subject and reflection. Very interesting. The blue seems to work too. And hey, you''re my 3000th comment!</td>', 'I like the disorienting feeling found in the subject and reflection. Very interesting. The blue seems to work too. And hey, you''re my 3000th comment!', '2008-12-27 21:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154161, 748904, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great street shot! I like the reflection but wish it were a little clearer. But that''s basic editing. Nice sepia tones here too. <br/> <br/>I''m calling this my pick of the challenge and giving it a ten and a fave. Good luck!</td>', 'Great street shot! I like the reflection but wish it were a little clearer. But that''s basic editing. Nice sepia tones here too.  I''m calling this my pick of the challenge and giving it a ten and a fave. Good luck!', '2008-12-27 21:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154182, 749442, 70852, '<td valign="top">My favorite one in this challenge. 9</td>', 'My favorite one in this challenge. 9', '2008-12-27 22:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154183, 748259, 70852, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. Good work. 8</td>', 'Very interesting shot. Good work. 8', '2008-12-27 22:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154269, 748259, 99981, '<td valign="top">The light is great, it makes the moment much better, because it gives an old aspect to it. I like the empty expression on his face, the border and the perspective of the photo. The only problems i see is that harsh aspect on some shoes, which could be less bright with some adjustments and the yellow that is maybe too much, and can be controled with some adjustments too! Nice shot! Probably one of the bests of this challenge.</td>', 'The light is great, it makes the moment much better, because it gives an old aspect to it. I like the empty expression on his face, the border and the perspective of the photo. The only problems i see is that harsh aspect on some shoes, which could be less bright with some adjustments and the yellow that is maybe too much, and can be controled with some adjustments too! Nice shot! Probably one of the bests of this challenge.', '2008-12-27 23:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154285, 749483, 47597, '<td valign="top">Sweet pic, but there is nothing in it to keep my attention for long.</td>', 'Sweet pic, but there is nothing in it to keep my attention for long.', '2008-12-27 23:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154289, 749622, 47597, '<td valign="top">A photo of a mannequin could be quite an interesting subject, but you''d need to present it more cleverly than this.</td>', 'A photo of a mannequin could be quite an interesting subject, but you''d need to present it more cleverly than this.', '2008-12-27 23:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154292, 749474, 47597, '<td valign="top">Love the tones and water on the glass. But I feel that concentrating on one of these faces may have made a better composition than half-half. I dunno.</td>', 'Love the tones and water on the glass. But I feel that concentrating on one of these faces may have made a better composition than half-half. I dunno.', '2008-12-27 23:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154295, 749551, 47597, '<td valign="top">Good idea!</td>', 'Good idea!', '2008-12-27 23:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154298, 749558, 47597, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if you had managed to find a better angle to shoot the car. This crop has chopped off part of the tyre and the bonnet too.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if you had managed to find a better angle to shoot the car. This crop has chopped off part of the tyre and the bonnet too.', '2008-12-27 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154303, 749631, 47597, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been more successful if you''d focused on just one of the dresses. Placing the doorway in the middle of the composition doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I think this would have been more successful if you''d focused on just one of the dresses. Placing the doorway in the middle of the composition doesn''t work for me.', '2008-12-27 23:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154306, 748758, 47597, '<td valign="top">My gut reaction to this shot is ''kinda nice''. But it seems to me that it is slanting to the left (or are both mannequins just wonky?)</td>', 'My gut reaction to this shot is ''kinda nice''. But it seems to me that it is slanting to the left (or are both mannequins just wonky?)', '2008-12-27 23:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154310, 749183, 47597, '<td valign="top">Nice shot through the window. I guess that you wanted to show the frame of the window on the left to let us know that you were shooting through a window - but it doesn''t look straight and I find the other cars in the background a bit of a distraction. Perhaps you could have tried to somehow take advantage of the reflection of that red sports car in the door of the Beetle in a different composition?</td>', 'Nice shot through the window. I guess that you wanted to show the frame of the window on the left to let us know that you were shooting through a window - but it doesn''t look straight and I find the other cars in the background a bit of a distraction. Perhaps you could have tried to somehow take advantage of the reflection of that red sports car in the door of the Beetle in a different composition?', '2008-12-27 23:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154311, 749280, 47597, '<td valign="top">Great idea.</td>', 'Great idea.', '2008-12-27 23:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154315, 748259, 47597, '<td valign="top">I love to see a shot that isn''t all snow and tinsel! Top marks for doing a shot with a human interest. Beautiful and interesting shot with lots of detail for my eyes to wander over. Seems pretty orange though?</td>', 'I love to see a shot that isn''t all snow and tinsel! Top marks for doing a shot with a human interest. Beautiful and interesting shot with lots of detail for my eyes to wander over. Seems pretty orange though?', '2008-12-27 23:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154318, 749442, 47597, '<td valign="top">One of the better window-merchandise shots I''ve seen so far. I think I would have preferred a crop that removed the yellow line at the bottom.</td>', 'One of the better window-merchandise shots I''ve seen so far. I think I would have preferred a crop that removed the yellow line at the bottom.', '2008-12-27 23:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154320, 749518, 47597, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.', '2008-12-27 23:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
