(5154516, 749545, 83313, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, but the way the car window is only slightly framing it does not work for me. I think if the cars window frame were either more obvious or not in the picture it would have come off better for me.</td>', 'Like the idea, but the way the car window is only slightly framing it does not work for me. I think if the cars window frame were either more obvious or not in the picture it would have come off better for me.', '2008-12-28 04:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154517, 748866, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of high ISO noise, or grainy artifacts of some kind showing here, and hurting the detail. Not sure what to suggest. This was clearly a shot of opportunity and I don''t know what else could have been done for it, other than some noise removal in post processing.</td>', 'There''s a lot of high ISO noise, or grainy artifacts of some kind showing here, and hurting the detail. Not sure what to suggest. This was clearly a shot of opportunity and I don''t know what else could have been done for it, other than some noise removal in post processing.', '2008-12-28 04:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154518, 748402, 83313, '<td valign="top">You can afford all of them. We are cheap.</td>', 'You can afford all of them. We are cheap.', '2008-12-28 04:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
