(5154521, 749381, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grainy, oversharpened, too much compression, too small, low contrast (have I hit all the flaws yet?), and exactly the kind of spoof I love to see. Can''t give you a really high vote for the previously mentioned traits, but I hope you will enjoy having my blue shoehorn award for injecting some humor into a serious challenge. Well done!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Oh, and the composition is too centered. (I still love it, however!)</td>', 'Grainy, oversharpened, too much compression, too small, low contrast (have I hit all the flaws yet?), and exactly the kind of spoof I love to see. Can''t give you a really high vote for the previously mentioned traits, but I hope you will enjoy having my blue shoehorn award for injecting some humor into a serious challenge. Well done!  Oh, and the composition is too centered. (I still love it, however!)', '2008-12-28 05:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5154522, 749474, 83313, '<td valign="top">I expect to see this one in the top ten. I woudl like to know how you did your b/w adjsutments on this. Very smooth.</td>', 'I expect to see this one in the top ten. I woudl like to know how you did your b/w adjsutments on this. Very smooth.', '2008-12-28 05:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
