(5159355, 748269, 28742, '<td valign="top">Too bad about not having the original. This was clearly a top ten finisher, were it not DQ''d. Obviously the guy is window shopping for some new explosives or weaponry. Your choice of lighting really brings out the details in his muscular arms. His expression says something like "Sh*t! I caint afode dat!" <br/> <br/>Really I think you should plead your DQ in the the forums so everyone can offer their support and condolences.</td>', 'Too bad about not having the original. This was clearly a top ten finisher, were it not DQ''d. Obviously the guy is window shopping for some new explosives or weaponry. Your choice of lighting really brings out the details in his muscular arms. His expression says something like "Sh*t! I caint afode dat!"  Really I think you should plead your DQ in the the forums so everyone can offer their support and condolences.', '2008-12-31 04:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5159368, 749423, 82749, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Congrats on the blue.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Congrats on the blue.', '2008-12-31 05:10:38.000000', NULL, 0),
