(5159455, 749272, 75192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yospiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I have one more shoehorn for to give out for this challenge and you are the recipient. Display it proudly or hang your head in shame, your choice. Thanks for the injecting a little humor into the challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737194" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737194.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737194.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737194.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Spiff, but in my opinion this is not a shoehorn... it is a picture shot through a shop window.... could you expand on why you think it is a shoehorn?<br/> <br/>It matches the challenge description perfectly: <br/>"Challenge Description:<br/>Take a photograph looking through, or of, a store window"<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by yospiff: I have one more shoehorn for to give out for this challenge and you are the recipient. Display it proudly or hang your head in shame, your choice. Thanks for the injecting a little humor into the challenge.   Thanks Spiff, but in my opinion this is not a shoehorn... it is a picture shot through a shop window.... could you expand on why you think it is a shoehorn? It matches the challenge description perfectly: "Challenge Description:Take a photograph looking through, or of, a store window" ', '2008-12-31 07:04:31.000000', NULL, 0),
