(5173596, 749280, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wooooohoooo!  I''ve been away for a week and I come back to find you not only ribboning in one open challenge but inspiring the winner in the other! Once again, you find magic in the mundane, beauty in the banal.<br/> <br/>Congrats!</td>', 'Wooooohoooo!  I''ve been away for a week and I come back to find you not only ribboning in one open challenge but inspiring the winner in the other! Once again, you find magic in the mundane, beauty in the banal. Congrats!', '2009-01-05 20:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174048, 749423, 68504, '<td valign="top">It is your model''s expression that carries this beyond the chocolate box.  (Loved the notes).<br/> <br/>ETA: Details and lighting just the right degree.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-06 00:21:36.</i></td>', 'It is your model''s expression that carries this beyond the chocolate box.  (Loved the notes). ETA: Details and lighting just the right degree.', '2009-01-06 00:19:04.000000', '2009-01-06 00:21:36.000000', 0),
(5174060, 748259, 68504, '<td valign="top">Vikram, this is stunning. The yellow area of the shoe shop, and the orange area about the shoe mender, and the radically different lighting in each, are what set this up for me, so that I can play the two against each other.  The shoe mender by himself - his posture on the box against the textured background is a picture in itself.  Great complexities indicated, sharpness not required.</td>', 'Vikram, this is stunning. The yellow area of the shoe shop, and the orange area about the shoe mender, and the radically different lighting in each, are what set this up for me, so that I can play the two against each other.  The shoe mender by himself - his posture on the box against the textured background is a picture in itself.  Great complexities indicated, sharpness not required.', '2009-01-06 00:28:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174066, 749614, 68504, '<td valign="top">This certainly caught my eye.  Like Vikram''s shot, this has two worlds and the intriguing effect of 2 different kinds of lighting which you really did pull off.</td>', 'This certainly caught my eye.  Like Vikram''s shot, this has two worlds and the intriguing effect of 2 different kinds of lighting which you really did pull off.', '2009-01-06 00:32:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174072, 749474, 68504, '<td valign="top">What <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=69325" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">smardaz</a> said. Your bw conversion has a lot to do with the clever way this works.</td>', 'What  smardaz said. Your bw conversion has a lot to do with the clever way this works.', '2009-01-06 00:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174087, 749397, 68504, '<td valign="top">Love the postures, the drape and wrinkles of the clothes, all the comments AND the felicitous marriage of photo and title.</td>', 'Love the postures, the drape and wrinkles of the clothes, all the comments AND the felicitous marriage of photo and title.', '2009-01-06 00:43:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174092, 749649, 68504, '<td valign="top">I certainly agree with Melethia about the composition and lighting, but if I had to choose one word it would be faery''s "elegance."</td>', 'I certainly agree with Melethia about the composition and lighting, but if I had to choose one word it would be faery''s "elegance."', '2009-01-06 00:48:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174098, 748379, 68504, '<td valign="top">My reaction to this is emotional:  it fills me with angst and dread for our cold urban glitzy consumer world.  The angles and reflections you have shown so well together with that cold metallic blue reinforce this feeling.</td>', 'My reaction to this is emotional:  it fills me with angst and dread for our cold urban glitzy consumer world.  The angles and reflections you have shown so well together with that cold metallic blue reinforce this feeling.', '2009-01-06 00:56:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174102, 749007, 68504, '<td valign="top">Another picture that provokes a reaction:  will someone please take one of those yummy round confections and quickly pop it into the moppets mouth!</td>', 'Another picture that provokes a reaction:  will someone please take one of those yummy round confections and quickly pop it into the moppets mouth!', '2009-01-06 00:59:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174107, 748904, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is quite a moment!  And the boy''s face reflected in the dark half of the female''s curiously bifurcated upper garment, almost balancing the patterns on the other half.  Quite a photo.</td>', 'This is quite a moment!  And the boy''s face reflected in the dark half of the female''s curiously bifurcated upper garment, almost balancing the patterns on the other half.  Quite a photo.', '2009-01-06 01:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174117, 749287, 68504, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and colour tones.  Together with the dark figure a sense of mood beyond what is seen.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and colour tones.  Together with the dark figure a sense of mood beyond what is seen.', '2009-01-06 01:11:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5174118, 748637, 68504, '<td valign="top">I find the connection between the two very compelling.</td>', 'I find the connection between the two very compelling.', '2009-01-06 01:14:59.000000', NULL, 0),
